      "text": "A table titled \"EPI: Open vial wastage rate by orgunit - last 12 months cumulative\", November 2015 to October 2016, giving the open vial wastage rate (%) of seven vaccines for two regions. Animal Region: BCG 5.8, DPT-HepB-Hib 4.1, IPV -20.1, MR blank, OPV 6.4, PCV 6, RV 6.3. Food Region: 6.4, 4.6, 20.4, blank, 6.4, 6.7, 5.9. The negative IPV rate for Animal Region is an impossible value, and MR is empty for both.",
